  "notes": "USAGE:\nCommonly used in business and academic contexts:\n- {事業|じぎょう}{概要|がいよう} (business overview)\n- {会社|かいしゃ}{概要|がいよう} (company overview/profile)\n- {製品|せいひん}{概要|がいよう} (product overview)\n- {概要|がいよう}{説明|せつめい} (summary explanation)\n- {概要|がいよう}を{把握|はあく}する (to grasp the outline)\n\nREGISTER:\nFormal/business. In casual contexts, use あらまし or ざっと.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {要約|ようやく} - summary, abstract (condensed version)\n- あらまし - outline, summary (less formal)\n- {大筋|おおすじ} - gist, main points\n- {要旨|ようし} - gist, essence\n- {要点|ようてん} - main point(s)",
